WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.368 --> 00:00:08.773
Scheduled reports email the numbers to the people who need them, every day, week, or month. In this video, you’ll put a report on a schedule.

2
00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:14.834
Open a report in Dashboards, under Reports. This one is the morning store report.

3
00:00:15.853 --> 00:00:23.064
Click Email, and tick Send it on a schedule. Choose every day, weekdays, a day of the week, or a day of the month, and the time.

4
00:00:24.089 --> 00:00:31.001
Add who gets it. Each person gets their own copy, worked out as them, so they only see numbers they’re allowed to see.

5
00:00:32.027 --> 00:00:41.499
Every email starts with a short AI summary of what changed, with the numbers underneath. Anyone who can see the report can also click Email me a copy.

6
00:00:42.516 --> 00:00:45.247
That’s Scheduled reports. Next, Spaces.

